flowchart TB
 H[Human: objective and constraints] --> C[Intent and research contract]
 C --> A[JiuwenSwarm agent: plan, act, delegate, revise]
 A <--> P[Durable project: agenda, evidence, experiments]
 A --> D[AI4R: compatible capsule discovery]
 D --> B[Protected binding: pins, checks, effects, budget]
 B --> R[Portable CC runtime]
 R --> E[Native tools, jobs and explicit providers]
 E --> V[Checked observations and artifacts]
 V --> P
 V --> A
 Q[Admission and lifecycle policy] --> D
 R -. usage and issues .-> Q
 classDef native fill:#d9eafa,stroke:#336a96,color:#123;
 classDef guard fill:#e0f1e6,stroke:#3e7959,color:#123;
 class A,E native;
 class B,R,Q guard;
